stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> processing_pending: capture persisted
  processing_pending --> queued: LPUSH succeeds
  processing_pending --> recovery_wait: LPUSH fails or worker crashes
  queued --> processing: worker BRPOP
  recovery_wait --> queued: reaper after queue drains and age > 10m
  processing --> indexed_searchable: chunks and index stored
  processing --> retry_wait: stage error or timeout
  retry_wait --> queued: attempts 1-3 after 2/4/8s
  retry_wait --> failed_dead_letter: attempt 4

  note right of indexed_searchable
    sessions.status = indexed
    searchable_status = searchable
    enrichment_status currently remains pending
  end note

  note right of failed_dead_letter
    job is in synapse:dead
    sessions.status = failed
  end note
